# The order of the top-level rules in the magic database macOS compiles from
# magic-apple.txt and magic.txt (/usr/share/file/magic.mgc): `<Magdir file>
# <index of the rule among that file's top-level rules>`, first rule tried first.
# libmagic 5.41 sorts rules by strength with an unstable sort, so rules of
# equal strength run in whatever order that build's qsort left them.
